{"asset_key":"mn3/env_story_10351450","episode":"mn3","category":"env_story","story_id":"10351450","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1035145001:1":{"text":"この付近？えっと……遺跡か何かのこと？","source_cn":"附近？唔……你是指遗迹还是什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6B1D6236CE5A43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1035145002:0":{"text":"そういえば、商会の人がたくさん来てるらしいわ。","source_cn":"噢对了，说起来附近有很多商会的人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70CF7ECBD3AF4743","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1035145003:1":{"text":"でも、この付近には遺跡しかないし……まさか発掘した貴重な遺物を売ってるんじゃ！？それはダメ！遺跡を壊してしまう！","source_cn":"但这附近只有遗迹……难道他们在贩卖遗迹里搜刮出来的珍贵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB816B20C48AA5068","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:冬青学者维娜":{"text":"学者のヴィーナ","source":"冬青学者维娜","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}